      "causes": ["hyp.token-session", "hyp.client-cache"],
      "rationale": "The failures start after a bulk revocation (ev01) and the log lookup (ev04) finds grant-expired and session-revoked results for the sampled users, so the token story fits. The remedy is device-side: clearing the cache fixes the tested laptops (ev06), most of the roll-out (ev08) and a reinstall fixes the last two (ev10). The engineer scopes first, asks only for a one-laptop test before a roll-out, and tells the customer not to repeat the revocation. Two causes are accepted because the tokens were revoked server-side but only the stale client state kept the users out.",
